Perlahan-lahan dikurangi hingga 1250 ton.

645
00:49:37.053 --> 00:49:38.092
Seribu ...

646
00:49:40.591 --> 00:49:41.606
500...

647
00:49:50.928 --> 00:49:52.155
Menyelamatkan mesin

